                "$ref": "976f1ec0-c072-40f4-996a-68482bd26ab1"
              },
              "name": "Pharmacy Availability & Price Comparison",
              "documentation": "Shows the main user workflow for finding a medicine, viewing participating pharmacies, seeing reported availability, and comparing indicative prices. Availability and price are always shown as reported information associated with a timestamp and source, never as guaranteed real-time inventory or proof of medical suitability.\n\nRelated requirements: FR-05-FR-07, FR-10-FR-19, NFR-13-NFR-14, BR-03-BR-05",
