                "$ref": "e7e23f2b-5cd8-4cce-b713-c088814f1657"
              },
              "name": "Medicine Matching & Pharmacist Verification",
              "documentation": "Shows the complete workflow from identifying a potential medicine match through pharmacist review and verification/rejection. The system never autonomously approves a substitution: a potential match is always pending pharmacist review until an authorized pharmacist explicitly verifies or rejects it. An unauthorized reviewer is denied and no verified comparison is created.\n\nRelated requirements: FR-20-FR-27, BR-01, BR-02, BR-03, BR-06",
