              },
              "name": "Update Medicine Price",
              "documentation": "Shows how authorized pharmacy staff update an indicative medicine price. The price remains indicative, is associated with the relevant medicine and pharmacy/source, its update time is retained, and the sequence introduces no purchasing, payment or checkout step.\n\nRelated requirements: FR-18, FR-19, NFR-13, NFR-16, FR-38-FR-39",
