              },
              "name": "Refill Reminder Management",
              "documentation": "Shows how a user creates and manages a medicine refill reminder, including optional recurrence configuration, modification and cancellation. A reminder is a convenience feature only: no dosage modification, treatment advice, prescription change, diagnosis or autonomous medical recommendation is modelled.\n\nRelated requirements: FR-32, FR-33, FR-34",
