              },
              "name": "User & Role Management",
              "documentation": "Shows how an administrator manages user accounts and authorized roles. Restricted management actions follow the standard authorization pattern and are recorded as audit entries. Clinic / Health Centre is not modelled as an ordinary application role here, consistent with the SRS.\n\nRelated requirements: FR-35, FR-02-FR-04, NFR-01-NFR-04, FR-38-FR-39",
