              },
              "name": "Administrative Reporting & Audit",
              "documentation": "Shows how administrators access relevant reports and audit information. Only the domain records actually needed for the selected report (e.g. Medicine, shown here as a representative example; PharmacyAvailability, Price, Verification, IncorrectInformationReport and RefillReminder apply analogously) are retrieved, and access to sensitive information remains restricted by role.\n\nRelated requirements: FR-37, FR-38, FR-39, NFR-04, NFR-16",
